WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:10.000
Until October 7, you and other Israelis helped drive people from Gaza to hospitals in Israel. Will you work for dialogue and cooperation again?

00:12.266 --> 00:13.366
It's useless,

00:13.500 --> 00:15.100
It's not doing anything.

00:19.533 --> 00:22.800
And there is a war now,

00:25.533 --> 00:27.900
and it's a right war, I'm sorry to say.

00:27.900 --> 00:30.466
But it's a right war.

00:34.333 --> 00:35.833
There's no other way.

00:37.133 --> 00:38.166
It's hard,

00:39.800 --> 00:42.300
I'm crying a lot about it,

00:42.466 --> 00:43.900
but it has to be.

00:43.900 --> 00:47.200
The IDF is doing what they have to do now.

00:47.933 --> 00:52.066
I hope when... and it will finish soon,

00:52.666 --> 00:55.566
we will call and see if we'll be back.

00:58.433 --> 01:02.433
We will start over to talk about

01:02.433 --> 01:04.666
not about peace, about life.

01:08.133 --> 01:10.966
And I don't think that

01:11.633 --> 01:14.366
Derech Hachlama (medical transport charity)

01:14.366 --> 01:15.300
will be helpful.

01:15.700 --> 01:17.700
They have to do it in their own country.

01:17.866 --> 01:19.700
Someone else has to do it.

01:22.366 --> 01:25.066
We failed, we failed.

01:25.066 --> 01:29.266
My generation failed to make a safe place.

01:30.500 --> 01:31.833
Know the reason.

01:31.833 --> 01:35.966
New generations and new leaders have to grow up

01:37.366 --> 01:40.600
and take us to good places.
